# short-description: OTA-enabled eMMC image for the i.MX 6SoloX Blaze board
# long-description: An OSTree physical sysroot for the eMMC user area.
#
# No bootloader partition: U-Boot lives in the eMMC boot0 hardware partition,
# so it is written there by imx6sx-blaze.uuu rather than carried here.
part / --source otaimage --ondisk mmcblk --fstype=ext4 --align 8192
